ath><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0">We write from facts on your own site, put through up to 22 checks</span></span></li><li class="grid min-w-0 grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-2 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3"><span class="text-base-content/70 flex min-w-0 items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user mt-1 flex-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0">Put it live and link it to your other pages</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right text-primary hidden sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="font-semibold flex min-w-0 items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles mt-1 flex-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0">It goes live on your website by itself</span></span></li><li class="grid min-w-0 grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-2 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3"><